    text: "@scene_meta_participants: Torhh, Korrhan, Saresh, Giant tribes, Pazuzu, allied Igigi, Torrhen (embedded consciousness), Aeon Keepers (consciousness contact)"
  - line: 12
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_focus: The Giant tribes and allied Igigi perform the Deep Communion, joining their consciousness through the planetary matrix, reaching Torrhen's embedded awareness and then the Aeon Keepers beyond the Veil; the Keepers reveal the Nephilim summoning protocol, its lethal elemental convergence conditions, the fact that the Nephilim manifest either way, and the requirement that the alliance survive the ritual's shared suffering for the Giants to command them."
  - line: 13
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_continuity: 1 day after the council of desperation in scene 012.1; leads into the seven-day preparation for the Nephilim convergence in chapter 014"
  - line: 14
